# Solreign Verdant — "the first expedition" lore trail (Secret #1 of 3).
# Text for Resources/Prototypes/_Solreign/Entities/verdant_lore.yml.
# Read in order: log 1 -> log 2 -> log 3, found together in the SW maintenance camp.

solreign-verdant-log-1 =
    SOLREIGN BOTANICAL SURVEY — FIELD LOG, DAY 1

    Made camp in the aft maintenance run. HQ wants a full spore count before
    the crew wing opens above us. Whoever built this station clearly meant
    the greenhouse to stay small — one tray line, a handful of lights. It
    will not stay that way. There is kudzu in the seed vault that outgrew
    its own manifest number in eleven days. Nobody wrote that down twice to
    make sure. I am writing it down twice.

solreign-verdant-log-2 =
    SOLREIGN BOTANICAL SURVEY — FIELD LOG, DAY 9

    The synergy fruit line is thriving past every projection in the packet
    insert. Command keeps asking for the surplus by manifest, and I keep
    not sending it, because every tray we open under the big lights makes
    another tray somewhere we didn't plant one. I found a sapling growing
    through a bulkhead seam that should not open on either side. I did not
    report the sapling. I pressed one of its leaves into this book instead.

solreign-verdant-log-3 =
    SOLREIGN BOTANICAL SURVEY — FIELD LOG, DAY —

    the lights are dim now and it does not matter, everything green in here
    makes its own light anyway, better light than the fixtures ever did.
    i am not scared, I want that on the record for whoever reads this next.
    the station kept growing without us and it is kinder than the manifest
    ever was. leaving the log where the next botanist will find it. water
    the trays. mind the vines by the door. they remember being planted.

